@startuml seq-compose-from-contact
' Context: contacts → navigation
' Profile: client
' SDD: PROM-PERSONAL-CONTACTS-006
' Revision: 2026-07-27

title Contacts — scorciatoia «Scrivi» da rubrica

actor Utente
participant "UI" as UI
participant "NavigationMachine" as Nav

Utente -> UI : StartChatFromContact

alt contatto internal
  UI -> UI : risolvi ChatPeer da contatto
  UI -> Nav : OpenPeerOnFocusedAccount(peer)
  Nav --> UI : ConversationVisible
  UI --> Utente : ChatFromContactStarted
else contatto esterno
  UI --> Utente : ChatFromContactRejected\n(esterno non supportato)
end

@enduml
